{1}{Yes, Magnus.  The symbol is the same.  [He puts his hand over his chest, nodding gravely.]  You are of the Iron Clan, Magnus Shale Fist.  I, Loghaire Thunder Stone of the Wheel Clan, pledge my friendship to you and your people.  May the Iron Clan again rise to its ancient glory...}{Yes, Magnus.  The symbol is the same.  [He puts his hand over his chest, nodding gravely.]  You are of the Iron Clan, Magnus Shale Fist.  I, Loghaire Thunder Stone of the Wheel Clan, pledge my friendship to you and your people.  May the Iron Clan again rise to its ancient glory...}{}{1}{}{}
