{4}{[Chuckling.] My grandfather told me the same stories.  [Then, more seriously.] You have much to consider, Magnus Shale Fist.  The Iron Clan and all of its history are now in your hands.  Your clan will need a chieftan, and I see no better dwarf than you assume that position.  [He gives Magnus a stern gaze.]  Such a responsibility is not taken lightly.  Remember that, in the days to come...}{[Chuckling.] My grandfather told me the same stories.  [Then, more seriously.] You have much to consider, Magnus Shale Fist.  The Iron Clan and all of its history are now in your hands.  Your clan will need a chieftan, and I see no better dwarf than you assume that position.  [He gives Magnus a stern gaze.]  Such a responsibility is not taken lightly.  Remember that, in the days to come...}{}{2}{}{}
{5}{Hold, Loghaire.  Will you be the Iron Clan's King as well..?}{}{5}{}{8}{}
{6}{Loghaire...you be King over Iron Clan, too...?}{}{-4}{}{8}{}
