{8}{That will be up to Magnus, and is also a matter of grave importance.  All dwarves who follow the Thunder Stone do so of their own choice.  I would welcome the Iron Clan to our kingdom, but the choice must be made by its chieftan...}{That will be up to Magnus, and is also a matter of grave importance.  All dwarves who follow the Thunder Stone do so of their own choice.  I would welcome the Iron Clan to our kingdom, but the choice must be made by its chieftan...}{}{3}{}{}
